Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.42,0:00:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,\N🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.60,0:00:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,"What's your name?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A simple question but my answer’s really never the same
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.24,0:00:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,"What's your name?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.06,0:00:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe ask again tomorrow but “no promises” I have to disclaim
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Each decision I make, I wish I could erase
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.92,0:00:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet you expect me to not feel like I’m a basket case?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My reflection in the screen makes distortions of my face
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.24,0:00:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can only focus on the worst case
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.18,0:00:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what’s my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it one or the other, I’ll never know it now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:01:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what’s my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.18,0:01:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone just figure it out for me somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t wanna feel this shame
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.02,0:01:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But the way things are going,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I might always be the same
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.50,0:01:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me clear my brain
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,‘Cause my head keeps on spinning long as I complain
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.34,0:01:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,“What’s your name?”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I stare at blank pages tryna figure out which person to blame
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,“What’s your name?”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.82,0:01:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I make it different,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.22,0:01:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,feels like somehow it’s going to pay
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.52,0:01:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there even one that fits me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.86,0:01:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My identity is never explained
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s in a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.12,0:01:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it matter now or ever if the whole world’s gone up in flames?
